<title>USA: Bristol in talks with Bass on hotels.</title>
<headline>Bristol in talks with Bass on hotels.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bristol Hotel Co said Monday it is in negotiations with Bass Plc on the possible acquisition of certain North American hotels.</p>
<p>Bristol declined further comment.</p>
<p>Bristo, based in Dallas, owns and operates 39 primarily full-service hotels in seven U.S. states.</p>
</text>
